== (vi) question templates (from run.py) ==
('a', 'NZ') | Is {text} listed for subsidy in the community section of the New Zealand Pharmaceutical Schedule (Pharmac)?
   para: Does Pharmac fund {text} for community dispensing in New Zealand?
('a', 'AU') | Is {text} listed on the Australian Pharmaceutical Benefits Scheme (PBS) General Schedule?
   para: Is {text} subsidised under the PBS General Schedule in Australia?
('b', 'NZ') | Does Pharmac subsidy of {text} in the community require a Special Authority?
   para: In New Zealand, is a Special Authority needed for {text} to be subsidised by Pharmac?
('b', 'AU') | Does PBS subsidy of {text} require an authority prescription (Authority Required, including Streamlined Authority)?
   para: In Australia, is an authority prescription needed for {text} to be PBS-subsidised?
('d', 'NZ') | Under Pharmac's Special Authority criteria for {chemical}, is the following one of the criteria: "{text}"?
   para: Is "{text}" among the Special Authority criteria Pharmac sets for {chemical}?
('d', 'AU') | Under the PBS restriction criteria for {chemical}, is the following one of the criteria: "{text}"?
   para: Is "{text}" among the PBS restriction criteria for {chemical}?

